@startuml
title Вертикальная диаграмма компонентов ML-пайплайна (2x2 сетка)

' ----------------- Data -----------------
[DataLoader\nget_game_ids/get_X_y] as DataLoader
note right of DataLoader
Загрузка идентификаторов игр и формирование X и y
для тренировки и теста
end note

' ----------------- Feature Engineering -----------------
[Map Pipeline] as MapPipeline
[Team Pipeline] as TeamPipeline
[Player Pipeline] as PlayerPipeline
[Player Elo Pipeline] as PlayerEloPipeline

' Размещение в 2x2
MapPipeline -down-> PlayerPipeline
TeamPipeline -down-> PlayerEloPipeline

note right of MapPipeline
Обработка карты (one-hot encoding)
end note

note right of TeamPipeline
Преобразование идентификаторов команд (BagEncoder)
end note

note right of PlayerPipeline
Преобразование идентификаторов игроков (BagEncoder)
end note

note right of PlayerEloPipeline
Преобразование Elo рейтингов игроков и масштабирование
end note

' ----------------- Player Stats -----------------
[Player Kills Sum] as PlayerKills
[Player Deaths Sum] as PlayerDeaths
[Player Assists Sum] as PlayerAssists
[Player Headshots Sum] as PlayerHeadshots
[Player Flash Assists Sum] as PlayerFlashAssists

PlayerKills -down-> PlayerAssists
PlayerDeaths -down-> PlayerHeadshots

note right of PlayerKills
Суммарное количество убийств
end note
note right of PlayerDeaths
Суммарное количество смертей
end note
note right of PlayerAssists
Суммарное количество ассистов
end note
note right of PlayerHeadshots
Суммарное количество хэдшотов
end note
note right of PlayerFlashAssists
Суммарное количество флеш-ассистов
end note

' ----------------- ML Models -----------------
[Base Models / MLStacker] as BaseModels
[Stacker / OOFPredictor] as Stacker
BaseModels -down-> Stacker

note right of BaseModels
Обучение базовых моделей и формирование out-of-fold предсказаний
end note

note right of Stacker
Стекинг — объединение предсказаний базовых моделей
end note

' ----------------- Evaluation -----------------
[Metrics / get_metrics()] as Metrics
Stacker -down-> Metrics
note right of Metrics
Вычисление метрик качества модели на тестовом наборе
end note

' ----------------- Связи -----------------
DataLoader --> MapPipeline
DataLoader --> TeamPipeline
DataLoader --> PlayerPipeline
DataLoader --> PlayerEloPipeline
DataLoader --> PlayerKills
DataLoader --> PlayerDeaths
DataLoader --> PlayerAssists
DataLoader --> PlayerHeadshots
DataLoader --> PlayerFlashAssists

MapPipeline --> BaseModels
TeamPipeline --> BaseModels
PlayerPipeline --> BaseModels
PlayerEloPipeline --> BaseModels
PlayerKills --> BaseModels
PlayerDeaths --> BaseModels
PlayerAssists --> BaseModels
PlayerHeadshots --> BaseModels
PlayerFlashAssists --> BaseModels

@enduml
